The kage-agents, kawaii-bar and kawaii-pane panels are modified copies of
panels shipped by Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app).
They retain Herdr's Apache License 2.0, included in LICENSE-Herdr.txt.

The personal variants add numbered agent navigation, custom pane headers,
and the Kawaii toolbar. Their rendering code has been reorganized.
